---
const title = 'Cookie Policy · Zymplo';
const description = 'How Zymplo uses cookies and similar technologies on its website.';
const lastUpdated = '2026-05-04';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#14B8A6" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://zymplo.com/en/legal/cookies/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://zymplo.com/legal/cookies/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt-BR" href="https://zymplo.com/pt/legal/cookies/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://zymplo.com/en/legal/cookies/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://zymplo.com/legal/cookies/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 64px; color: #0A0B14; line-height: 1.65; background: #FAFBFF; }
      header { padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      header img { height: 40px; }
      h1 { font-size: 32px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
      h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 32px 0 12px; color: #0F9488; }
      h3 { font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; }
      p, li { font-size: 16px; }
      a { color: #14B8A6; }
      .meta { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; }
      th, td { border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; }
      th { background: #ECFEFE; }
      footer { margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="https://zymplo.com/"><img src="/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" /></a>
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      <p class="meta"><a href="/legal/cookies/">Español</a> · <a href="/pt/legal/cookies/">Português</a> · English</p>
    </header>

    <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small files that the website stores in your browser to remember preferences · measure usage · improve your experience. This policy applies to <strong>zymplo.com</strong> and its subdomains. The <strong>main Zymplo platform (WhatsApp bot)</strong> does NOT use cookies — only the website.</p>

    <h2>2. What cookies we use</h2>

    <h3>Strictly necessary (cannot be rejected)</h3>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>zymplo-theme</td><td>Remember dark/light mode</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
        <tr><td>cf_clearance</td><td>Cloudflare anti-bot verification</td><td>30 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>__cf_bm</td><td>Cloudflare anti-bot</td><td>30 min</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>Analytics (rejectable)</h3>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>_ga · _gid</td><td>Google Analytics 4 · anonymized traffic measurement</td><td>2 years · 24h</td></tr>
        <tr><td>_fbp</td><td>Meta Pixel · measure campaign effectiveness (only if you arrived via an ad)</td><td>90 days</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>Marketing (rejectable · NOT enabled by default)</h3>
    <p>We do not use third-party advertising cookies. If we ever enable remarketing · we will ask for your explicit opt-in.</p>

    <h2>3. How you control cookies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cookie banner:</strong> on your first visit you can reject all except the necessary ones.</li>
      <li><strong>Browser settings:</strong> Chrome / Firefox / Safari let you block third-party cookies from their settings.</li>
      <li><strong>Reset preferences:</strong> email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a> and we will clear whatever we have.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Other technologies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>localStorage:</strong> we use it to store your theme preference (dark/light) · it stays in your browser only · never reaches the server.</li>
      <li><strong>Pixel tags:</strong> Meta Pixel when you arrived via an ad (rejectable along with _fbp).</li>
      <li><strong>Web beacons:</strong> we do NOT use them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Changes</h2>
    <p>If we update this policy · we will publish the new date above and · if the changes are substantial · we will notify you in the site banner.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact</h2>
    <p>Cookies / privacy: <a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a></p>

    <footer>
      <p>Zymplo Inc. · Delaware USA · EIN 30-1486305 · Zymplo Brasil LTDA · CNPJ 66.667.634/0001-00 · Fortaleza CE</p>
      <p><a href="/">Back to zymplo.com</a> · <a href="/en/legal/privacy/">Privacy</a> · <a href="/en/legal/terms/">Terms</a> · <a href="/en/legal/delete-account/">Delete account</a></p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
